      "id": "claim_7051b663c5c0415f825ae67f152ca335",
      "statement": "SearchInput carries user_input (1-200 chars), thread_id (UUID), and country (default '', meaning worldwide), so the /ask and /askeval frontend HTTP contract is {user_input, thread_id, country}; /reset also accepts this model (only thread_id is used) for its config.",
