      "id": "claim_19d8826606224384a41a6dbe897206c0",
      "statement": "Lifespan compiles TWO graphs from the same agent.graph: `agent` backed by PostgresSaver (persisted across days, PostgresSaver.setup() runs at startup so an unreachable DATABASE_URL fails the boot) and `eval_agent` backed by InMemorySaver (process-local, used only by /askeval); both are module globals assigned inside the lifespan context manager.",
