    {
      "id": "claim_86cc0d8651c041eb9cafbc12f0f0e136",
      "statement": "helper.llmchain(gemini_key, for_upload=False) builds gemini-2.5-flash at temperature=0.1 with max_retries=2 and timeout=10; the default chain is `llm | StrOutParser()` (built once at import, used by /feedback and /evaluate), and with for_upload=True it returns `llm.with_structured_output(CVKeywords)` — the variant built inside the Celery filework task, not at import. The retry count is 2, not the older 10.",
