    {
      "id": "claim_03b3f69dbc58473a95dde0cf8540af2a",
      "statement": "helper.run_agent(agent, user_input, thread_id, country, metadata=None) resets fetched_jobs to [] and invokes agent.invoke({user_input, country, fetched_jobs: []}, config with thread_id + metadata, durability=exit), returning (clean_jobs, memory, last_fetch_time); it is called by searchhelper and by the Celery filework task with a freshly compiled PostgresSaver-backed agent.",
