    {
      "id": "claim_f2ac14b031f24c8d9ae4adfcec2b992b",
      "statement": "searchhelper is the cache core shared by /ask, /digest, and /askeval. On a state miss it consults the Redis jobcache (jobcache(query,country) = jobs:{querylow}:{country}) only on non-eval calls: a hit loads cached {jobs, fetched_at} and update_states the thread without running the graph; a miss runs run_agent then r.set(savedjobs, json, ex=14400). Eval calls (metadata set) skip Redis entirely. The Redis key is query+country, so the cache is cross-thread; RedisError is caught and treated as a miss.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://main.py#L116-L154",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0dfcbe781f6665f0745a2216a2b170002adbe89318a34e099cad964af58d6403:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://main.py#L82-L85",
