    {
      "id": "claim_77c8fb6a91e24d53819ddcf5c4aaf273",
      "statement": "The rate limiter is keyed by my_key, which prefers the CF-Connecting-IP header and falls back to get_remote_address, with storage_uri=REDIS_URL and in_memory_fallback_enabled=True. Most endpoints are 10/min, but /jobs/{job_id} is 60/min and /health is not rate-limited at all; every rate-limited endpoint declares request: Request so slowapi can read the client address.",
